OL,3,AHome Alone and Schitt's Creek stars pay
OL,4,Atribute to late Catherine O'Hara
OL,5,
OL,6,FMacaulay Culkin, Annie Murphy and Dan
OL,7,FLevy delivered a poignant tribute to
OL,8,Ftheir late Home Alone and Schitt's
OL,9,FCreek co-star Catherine O'Hara.
OL,11,FCulkin remembered her as "our mom", and
OL,12,F"like a good mom, she always showed up
OL,13,Fwhen I asked her to". Referring to the
OL,14,Fplot of the Home Alone films, he joked:
OL,15,F"She may have forgotten me... twice!
OL,16,FBut we will always remember her."
OL,18,FNoah Kahan then performed Bridge Over
OL,19,FTroubled Water during the in memoriam
OL,20,Fsegment, before Jamie Lee Curtis paid
OL,21,Fan emotional tribute to actor and
OL,22,Fdirector Rob Reiner.
OL,23,APub: 15-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG11/18
